'''Elder's Missive''' drops from [[Ambassador Eka'ghar]] in [[Foulheart Sanctum]].

==As a quest objective==
* {{questlong|Neutral|56|Hooves and Horns, Clad in Red}}

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
Eka'ghar, we have made tremendous strides in establishing our new order. With each day, we convert more lost sheep into our flock, away from the empty lies told for ages by our hollow traditions. The worlds of our new god have reached the hearts of many plagued by the spiritual fatigue propagated by Moro'gai K'la. Unable to harness the full potential of the Draenethyst, they will crumble before our savior’s godly might; and then they will see. They will finally comprehend that their pride in the pitiful and obsolete scriptures of old is misguided. Those with clear hearts will see that our path is the only true way, and they will finally believe and ascend as one of his chosen.
----
Once you have completed the delivery, return to the sanctum. It is time we expand our reach even further, to remind this world that it is not beyond salvation.
}}

